- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Monday, 20 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class='item other'><div class='title'>The ICA is closed on Mondays.</div></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Tuesday, 21 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Tuesday, 21 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/caronte\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Caronte</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">5:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13434.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">The River Douro in Porto is the area of Portuguese maritime territory with the highest number of suicides by jumping. Gastão has dedicated his life to recovering these bodies, not to try to save them, but to return them to their families, who can only move on once they have been recovered.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item talks \"><div class=\"subhead sans talks\">\n                                              <a href=\"/talks\">Talks & Events</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/talks/pulse-maite-de-orbe\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">PULSE: Maite de Orbe</div></div><div class=\"time-container time talks\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13369.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">This iteration of PULSE focuses on the work of ICA Artist Development Resident Maite de Orbe. Across two days, de Orbe will present a work-in-progress installation, offering audiences an opportunity to engage with research and material developed during their residency.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/synthetic-sincerity-q-a\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Synthetic Sincerity + Q&A</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13435.webp\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">The Synthetic Sincerity Lab based at the University of Southern England are trying to create authentic AI characters as part of a new research project and licence the films of Marc Isaacs' to better understand what his AI characters are lacking.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/the-day-she-returns\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE </br>The Day She Returns</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:40 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13395.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A subtle meditation on memory and performance, Hong Sangsoo's latest film unfolds through a series of increasingly intimate conversations, as he continues his exploration of the boundaries between lived experience and artistic creation.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Wednesday, 22 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Wednesday, 22 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item talks \"><div class=\"subhead sans talks\">\n                                              <a href=\"/talks\">Talks & Events</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/talks/pulse-maite-de-orbe\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">PULSE: Maite de Orbe</div></div><div class=\"time-container time talks\"><div class=\"time-slot\">12:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13369.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">This iteration of PULSE focuses on the work of ICA Artist Development Resident Maite de Orbe. Across two days, de Orbe will present a work-in-progress installation, offering audiences an opportunity to engage with research and material developed during their residency.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/caronte\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Caronte</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">3:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13434.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">The River Douro in Porto is the area of Portuguese maritime territory with the highest number of suicides by jumping. Gastão has dedicated his life to recovering these bodies, not to try to save them, but to return them to their families, who can only move on once they have been recovered.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/the-day-she-returns\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE </br>The Day She Returns</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13395.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A subtle meditation on memory and performance, Hong Sangsoo's latest film unfolds through a series of increasingly intimate conversations, as he continues his exploration of the boundaries between lived experience and artistic creation.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/indeterminate-ecologies\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Indeterminate Ecologies: <br> Islands of Fire, It's Raining Frogs Outside, Fireworks (Archives), Mekong Hotel and Barbs, Wastelands</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13546.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">In dialogue with Elisa Giardina Papa's exhibition <i>She Flickered In and Out of History</i>, Iggy Cortez brings five short works: <i>Islands of Fire</i>, <i>It’s Raining Frogs Outside</i>, <i>Fireworks (Archives)</i>, <i>Mekong Hotel </i>and <i>Barbs, Wastelands</i>.&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Thursday, 23 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Thursday, 23 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/caronte\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Caronte</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">5:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13434.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">The River Douro in Porto is the area of Portuguese maritime territory with the highest number of suicides by jumping. Gastão has dedicated his life to recovering these bodies, not to try to save them, but to return them to their families, who can only move on once they have been recovered.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/the-day-she-returns\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE </br>The Day She Returns</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13395.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A subtle meditation on memory and performance, Hong Sangsoo's latest film unfolds through a series of increasingly intimate conversations, as he continues his exploration of the boundaries between lived experience and artistic creation.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/rozier-the-castaways-of-turtle-island\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Time to Play <br> Films by Jacques Rozier</div><div class=\"title \">The Castaways of Turtle Island</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13457.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Having framed his first two features as seaside holiday films, Rozier used the third, <i>The Castaways of Turtle Island,</i> to mock the tourist industry in a hilarious comic send-up that could only have emerged from Rozier’s puckish imagination.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Friday, 24 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Friday, 24 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/nostalgia-4k\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Nostalgia (4K Restoration)</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13450.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Andrei Tarkovsky's extraordinary and haunting exploration of exile, memory, and faith returns to the big screen in a new 4K restoration.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Saturday, 25 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Saturday, 25 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/rozier-maine-ocean-express\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Time to Play <br> Films by Jacques Rozier</div><div class=\"title \">Maine-Océan Express</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">2:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13458.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Applying his long take shooting style to episodic, anarchic zaniness, Rozier once more proves himself a master of making the patently absurd appear completely realistic, and vice versa, in this irresistible shaggy-dog story.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/nostalgia-4k\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Nostalgia (4K Restoration)</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">4:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13450.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Andrei Tarkovsky's extraordinary and haunting exploration of exile, memory, and faith returns to the big screen in a new 4K restoration.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Sunday, 26 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Sunday, 26 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/rozier-fifi-martingale\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Time to Play <br> Films by Jacques Rozier</div><div class=\"title \">Fifi Martingale</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">2:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13459.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Rozier’s final film is a joyful compendium of his major themes and strategies as well as one of the funniest depictions of the theatre ever committed to celluloid.&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/nostalgia-4k\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Nostalgia (4K Restoration)</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">4:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13450.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Andrei Tarkovsky's extraordinary and haunting exploration of exile, memory, and faith returns to the big screen in a new 4K restoration.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Monday, 27 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Monday, 27 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                      