                <div class=\"description sans\">Andrei Tarkovsky's extraordinary and haunting exploration of exile, memory, and faith returns to the big screen in a new 4K restoration.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/members-screening-le-deuxieme-souffle\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Member Screening: Le deuxième souffle</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13409.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A special screening of Jean-Pierre Melville's <i>Le deuxième souffle</i>, exclusively for ICA Members and their guests</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Wednesday, 29 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Wednesday, 29 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/nostalgia-4k\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Nostalgia (4K Restoration)</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13450.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Andrei Tarkovsky's extraordinary and haunting exploration of exile, memory, and faith returns to the big screen in a new 4K restoration.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/monisme\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Monisme </div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13544.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">In dialogue with Elisa Giardina Papa's exhibition <i>She Flickered In and Out of History</i>, Onyeka Igwe presents <i>Monisme</i> (2023) directed by Riar Rizaldi, a film situated around Mount Merapi, an active volcano in Indonesia.&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item talks \"><div class=\"subhead sans talks\">\n                                              <a href=\"/talks\">Talks & Events</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/talks/gushing-to-perform-if-i-may\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Gushing to Perform: IF I MAY</div></div><div class=\"time-container time talks\"><div class=\"time-slot\">7:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13248.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Four artists working across voice, performance, and movement explore what it means to extend the self outward – and to stay present for what returns. Curated by PRIM, the evening features Nali, Sienna King, Sabrena Osei-Tutu, and Cash Nahuo.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Thursday, 30 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Thursday, 30 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/nostalgia-4k\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Nostalgia (4K Restoration)</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">4:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13450.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Andrei Tarkovsky's extraordinary and haunting exploration of exile, memory, and faith returns to the big screen in a new 4K restoration.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item talks \"><div class=\"subhead sans talks\">\n                                              <a href=\"/talks\">Talks & Events</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/talks/members-book-club-transcription-by-ben-lerner\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Members' Book Club: Transcription by Ben Lerner</div></div><div class=\"time-container time talks\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13233.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\"></div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/rozier-fifi-martingale\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Time to Play <br> Films by Jacques Rozier</div><div class=\"title \">Fifi Martingale</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13459.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Rozier’s final film is a joyful compendium of his major themes and strategies as well as one of the funniest depictions of the theatre ever committed to celluloid.&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/rozier-from-one-wave-to-another\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Time to Play <br> Films by Jacques Rozier</div><div class=\"title \">Jacques Rozier: From One Wave to Another</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:40 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13460.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Jacques Rozier’s filmmaking stands out for its originality, innovation, and nonconformity. Emmanuel Barnault's documentary delves into Rozier’s impromptu creativity and direct approach offering a captivating look at the enduring relevance and influence of his work in contemporary cinema.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Friday, 31 July</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Friday, 31 July</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item talks \"><div class=\"subhead sans talks\">\n                                              <a href=\"/talks\">Talks & Events</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/talks/marfa-launch-screening-looking-for-mr-goodbar\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">MARFA presents: <br> Looking for Mr Goodbar</div></div><div class=\"time-container time talks\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13498.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A special screening of <i>Lo</i><i>oking for Mr. Goodbar </i>with France-Lise McGurn<i>,&nbsp;</i>presented by MARFA journal.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/ish\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Ish</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13431.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram wrestle to hold on to their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Saturday, 1 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Saturday, 1 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/oshima-the-catch\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Cinema and State </br>Films by Nagisa Ōshima</div><div class=\"title \">The Catch</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">4:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13504.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">An adaptation of Nobel laureate Kenzaburo Oe's unsettling and politically trenchant fable, Nagisa Ōshima's <i>The Catch </i>tells the story of an African-American pilot captured by the inhabitants of a remote mountain village in the final days of WWII.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/ish\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Ish</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13431.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram wrestle to hold on to their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item live \"><div class=\"subhead sans live\">\n                                              <a href=\"/live\">Live</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/live/marika-peura-amalgam-melee\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Marika Peura: Amalgam Melee </div></div><div class=\"time-container time live\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13589.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Finnish choreographer Marika Peura presents a live performance exploring cultural heritage, Brownness, Whiteness, and the body's entanglement with power and violence through dance, costume, and charged symbols of identity.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Sunday, 2 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Sunday, 2 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/ish\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Ish</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13431.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram wrestle to hold on to their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Monday, 3 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Monday, 3 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class='item other'><div class='title'>The ICA is closed on Mondays.</div></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Tuesday, 4 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Tuesday, 4 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/oshima-the-catch\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Cinema and State </br>Films by Nagisa Ōshima</div><div class=\"title \">The Catch</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13504.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">An adaptation of Nobel laureate Kenzaburo Oe's unsettling and politically trenchant fable, Nagisa Ōshima's <i>The Catch </i>tells the story of an African-American pilot captured by the inhabitants of a remote mountain village in the final days of WWII.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item live \"><div class=\"subhead sans live\">\n                                              <a href=\"/live\">Live</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/live/cate-le-bon\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Cate Le Bon</div></div><div class=\"time-container time live\"><div class=\"time-slot\">7:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13316.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Welsh multi-disciplinary artist and producer Cate Le Bon’s work has long defied categorization—an architect of sound who builds emotional landscapes from abstraction, texture, and tone. We are delighted to welcome her and her band for two nights in August.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/ish\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Ish</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:40 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13431.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram wrestle to hold on to their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Wednesday, 5 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Wednesday, 5 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item live \"><div class=\"subhead sans live\">\n                                              <a href=\"/live\">Live</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/live/htrk\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">HTRK</div></div><div class=\"time-container time live\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:00 PM</div><div class=\"time-slot\">8:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13245.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">HTRK [‘hate rock'], the Australian duo of Jonnine Standish and Nigel Yang, have an uncanny ability to elevate musical mood to a singular, smouldering supremacy. Their songs are often coded as fantasies, venturing deeper into the heady expanses of dub dream and memory.<br>\r\n</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/ish\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Ish</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13431.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram wrestle to hold on to their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/oshima-death-by-hanging\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Cinema and State </br>Films by Nagisa Ōshima</div><div class=\"title \">Death By Hanging + Yunbogi's Diary</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">7:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13505.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">At once disturbing and oddly amusing, Ōshima's macabre farce about a man who survives his execution and throws the judiciary system into chaos, is a searing indictment of both capital punishment and the treatment of Korean immigrants in his country.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Thursday, 6 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Thursday, 6 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/ish\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Ish</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13431.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">12-year-old best friends Ish and Maram wrestle to hold on to their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/memory\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">Memory</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13396.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Vladlena Sandu, a survivor of the war in Chechnya, studies her traumatic memories in order to transcend and transform them via cinema in her poetic debut feature.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Friday, 7 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Friday, 7 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-camping-du-lac\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE</br>Camping du Lac + Q&A</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13461.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Éléonore drives West. Her car breaks down in the middle of Brittany, France. She rents a bungalow on a campsite with a view of the lake, in which, it is said, lives a legendary beast. From mobile home to mobile home, she observes the present, summons the past and lets herself be invaded by fiction.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/memory\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">Memory</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13396.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Vladlena Sandu, a survivor of the war in Chechnya, studies her traumatic memories in order to transcend and transform them via cinema in her poetic debut feature.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-personal-problems\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">Personal Problems + Intro</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13462.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A raw, improvisational “meta–soap opera” directed by Bill Gunn (<i>Ganja &amp; Hess</i>) that captures Black working-class life in late-1970s Harlem with startling intimacy.&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-richard-heslop\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">A Collection of Short Films by Richard Heslop</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13463.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">This special programme brings together four shorts from between 1984 - 1992 by music video director Richard Heslop with an intro from archivist Nicole Atkinson.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Saturday, 8 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Saturday, 8 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-herostratus\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">Herostratus + Intro</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">12:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13464.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A 1967 British experimental psychological drama, Don Levy’s <i>Herostratus</i> is named after a legend of a man who burned down the Temple of Artemis to achieve immortal fame. It follows Michael Gothard (<i>The Devils</i>) as a young poet who proposes to a marketing firm that they turn his suicide into a mass media spectacle.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/memory\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">Memory</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">2:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13396.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Vladlena Sandu, a survivor of the war in Chechnya, studies her traumatic memories in order to transcend and transform them via cinema in her poetic debut feature.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-women-as-lovers\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE</br>Women as Lovers + Q&A</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">3:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13465.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">The lovers are trade fair hostess Brigitte (Johanna Wokalek) and young Paula (Hannah Schiller). Faced with the shrinking market value of her femininity, Brigitte makes wealthy Heinz (Ben Mün-chow) her lover. She just manages to make her way to the top, while Paula has yet to learn the hardships of life.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/oshima-death-by-hanging\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Cinema and State </br>Films by Nagisa Ōshima</div><div class=\"title \">Death By Hanging + Yunbogi's Diary</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">4:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13505.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">At once disturbing and oddly amusing, Ōshima's macabre farce about a man who survives his execution and throws the judiciary system into chaos, is a searing indictment of both capital punishment and the treatment of Korean immigrants in his country.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-you-sorta-know-it-s-gonna-end\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE</br>You Sorta Know It's Gonna End + Q&A</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">5:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13466.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Electric Blue Cinema presents the UK premiere of a new video mixtape from emerging Canadian directors Kalil Haddad and Ryan Steel, exploring lo-fi aesthetic, youth in flux, and the very notion of experimental filmmaking in 2026.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-drinking-and-driving\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE</br>Drinking and Driving + Q&A</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13467.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Early twenties Iris (Jillian Frank) and Palmer (Avalon Fast) never left their hometown. They work at the same restaurant, share the same bed, and both have a habit of drinking and driving.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><!--<div class='program sans'>Daily Program</div>--><div id='' class=\"date-title\"><div class=\"head fold\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker\">\n            <div class=\"docket-date-container\">\n                <div class=\"docket-date\">Sunday, 9 August</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- <div id=\"docket-date-small-header\">Sunday, 9 August</div> --></div><div id = 'filter_container'>\n                                <ul id='filter-2' class = 'item'>\n                                    <li class = 'year sans '>\n                                        <a class = \"year-btn\" href = '/today' >Today</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/tomorrow'>Tomorrow</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans '>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/next-7-days'>Next 7 days</a>\n                                    </li><li class = 'year sans active'>\n                                            <a class = 'year-btn' href = '/upcoming'>Everything</a>\n                                    </li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div><div class=\"other sans programme-header\">Daily Programme</div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/memory\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Off-Circuit</div><div class=\"title \">Memory</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">2:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13396.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Vladlena Sandu, a survivor of the war in Chechnya, studies her traumatic memories in order to transcend and transform them via cinema in her poetic debut feature.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/oshima-diary-of-a-shinjuku-thief\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">Cinema and State </br>Films by Nagisa Ōshima</div><div class=\"title \">Diary of a Shinjuku Thief</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">2:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13506.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">When a thief is caught stealing form a book shop by one of its employees, the two embark on an unusual, erotic adventure. Set against the vivid backdrop of the massive student-led riots, Nagisa Ōshima's radical concoction of cinema verité, underground kabuki and just about everything in-between, is a striking meditation on the psychosexual ambiguities of the postwar counterculture.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/tfff-a-rimbaud\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">The Final Film Festival</div><div class=\"title \">UK PREMIERE</br>A. Rimbaud + Q&A</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13468.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">The improbable life of French poet Arthur Rimbaud unfolds with all the shock and playfulness of his poetry.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item exhibitions \"><div class=\"subhead sans exhibitions\">\n                                              <a href=\"/exhibitions\">Exhibitions</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/exhibitions/elisa-giardina-papa-she-flickered-in-and-out-of-history\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Elisa Giardina Papa: <br> She Flickered In and Out of History</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/13133.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A new video and mixed-media installation by Elisa Giardina Papa exploring the geological, mythological and political temporalities of the Mediterranean through a historical and speculative story of a vanished island.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div></div>      </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<script>\n// var endDate = \"2026-08-10\";\n// function loadMore() {\n//     document.getElementById('spinner').style.display = 'block';\n//     document.getElementById('more').style.display = 'none';\n\n//     var xhttp = new XMLHttpRequest();\n\n//     xhttp.onreadystatechange = function() {\n//       if (this.readyState == 4 && this.status == 200) {\n//         var div = document.getElementById('ladder').children[0];\n//         div.innerHTML += this.responseText;\n//         document.getElementById('spinner').style.display = 'none';\n//         document.getElementById('more').style.display = 'block';\n//         get_folds();\n//       }\n//     };\n//     var queryString = \"views/load-more.php?date=\" + endDate + \"&dates_display=5\";\n//     endDate = endDate + \" + 5 days\";\n//     xhttp.open(\"GET\", queryString, true);\n//     xhttp.send();\n// }\n// if(typeof ajaxLoader != 'undefined') {\n//     console.log(endDate);\n//     let today = \"2026-07-11\";\n//     let requestUrl = \"static/php/ajaxHandler.php?date=\" + today;\n//     let currentNum = '30';\n//     let maxNum = '30';\n//     ajaxLoader.init(requestUrl, currentNum, maxNum, function(){\n//         document.querySelector('#ladder > div').classList.add('waiting');\n//     }, function(response){\n//         document.querySelector('#ladder > div').innerHTML += response;\n//         document.querySelector('#ladder > div').classList.remove('waiting');\n//     });\n// }\n</script>\n<div id='menu' class='sans'><a name='menu-top'></a><ul class=\"menu-column\"><img class=\"illusion light-mode-only\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/09617.svg\"><img class=\"illusion dark-mode-only\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/09620.svg\"><li class=\"menu-item black\"><a href=\"/calendar\">Calendar</a>\n                </li><li class=\"menu-item black subhead sans exhibitions\"><a href=\"/exhibit